# AI agents treat CLAUDE.md as instructions, and CI's checks and suppression files decide
# what can merge, so changes to them request the human owner's review. GitHub enforces
# that review only once the dev, staging and main rulesets turn on "Require review from
# Code Owners" (docs/CI.md).
/CLAUDE.md          @sandythomas1
/.github/           @sandythomas1
/.gitattributes     @sandythomas1
/scripts/ci/        @sandythomas1
# The deploy workflow rolls the gateway template and development.json on the next staging
# merge, and infra/ holds every cloud permission (#105).
/infra/             @sandythomas1
/.gitleaks.toml     @sandythomas1
**/.gitleaks.toml   @sandythomas1
**/.gitleaksignore  @sandythomas1
